# Shared knowledge

This project uses the Shared Knowledge MCP server.

## Default knowledge base

- Prefer the `kb_id` stored in `.cursor/kb-id` when present.
- If missing, call `list_knowledge_bases` before guessing.

## When to recall

Before answering architecture, decisions, stack, or “what did we decide” questions, call `recall` with the project `kb_id`.

## When to remember

When the user states a durable decision, fact, or constraint worth keeping across chats, call `remember` with:
- that `kb_id`
- a clear text summary
- a fresh UUID `idempotency_key`

## Do not

- Do not invent memories that were not recalled.
- Do not ask the user to re-explain known durable project facts before trying `recall`.
